WARNING - READ THIS BEFORE YOU RUN ANYTHING THIS SOFTWARE PRODUCES ON A MACHINE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

YOU ARE INSANE IF YOU USE THIS ON A REAL MACHINE RIGHT NOW. USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.

This is an experimental, unfinished reverse-engineering project. It is NOT
Mastercam and is not affiliated with or endorsed by CNC Software, Inc. The
toolpaths, G-code, posted programs and part files it generates are UNVERIFIED
and may be WRONG: wrong depths, wrong heights, rapids through stock or
fixtures, wrong tool numbers or offsets, wrong spindle direction, missing
coolant, or anything else.

Running its output on a CNC machine can crash the machine, break tools, ruin
parts and fixtures, start fires, and seriously injure or kill people. If you do
it anyway, you alone are responsible. Always verify every program yourself
(simulation, dry run above the part, single block, feed override at zero) before
cutting anything.

The program asks you to agree to this warning every time it starts.
